+questeditor.hint.overview = Progress mode: personal = each player has their own progress, party = shared inside a group, server = one shared world state.\nQuest giver: fill RefId by hand, or press "Pick in game" and activate the NPC once. UniqueIndex binds the quest to one exact NPC instance; "Any instance" clears it so every NPC with this RefId can give the quest.\nInitial stage must exist on the Stages tab before it can be saved.
